From 46734d73360985385faf9c2c8e7f40487a5672ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammad Reza <hoznaghashi@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:20:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Audit fixes: Engle-Granger stationarity, entry cooldown, time
 stop, Sortino, fit log throttle

- Stationarity: default engle_granger (MacKinnon) instead of invalid ADF-on-residual
- Entry: refuse beyond z_stop; cooldown after failed entry; XT one-way symbol clash guard
- Exit: max_holding_hours time_stop; close fill never uses entryPrice
- Backtest: signal-first stationarity; try_all_dependents; open_mtm mark; max_holding_bars
- Metrics: proper downside deviation for Sortino
- Persist OLS fits only on candidate or fit_log_interval_sec
- Profit gate fails closed on error
---
